# Only the baseline (track003_5), the last run before disturbances (track003_8)
# and the disturbance stages kept as releases (track003_10; track003_11, which
# improved on it under pushes; track003_12, which matched track003_11 under
# pushes and dropped the pen less often with randomized physics; track003_14,
# which dropped it less often than track003_12 under pushes with randomized
# physics) are kept in git, without their checkpoints and tensorboard logs;
# training logs stay local.
runs/*/
!runs/track003_5/
!runs/track003_8/
!runs/track003_10/
!runs/track003_11/
!runs/track003_12/
!runs/track003_14/
!runs/quicktests/
!runs/stage_eval/
runs/*/checkpoints/
runs/*/tb/
runs/*.log
